OL,3,GNEWSAWayne and Coleen Rooney climb
OL,4,AWales' highest mountain
OL,5,
OL,6,FEx-England footballer Wayne Rooney and
OL,7,Fhis wife Coleen climbed Wales' highest
OL,8,Fmountain during a "rare free weekend".
OL,10,FOne of Britain's most famous couples
OL,11,Fposted pictures of their walk up Yr
OL,12,FWyddfa, also known as Snowdon, on
OL,13,FInstagram.
OL,15,F"After a busy week... what do we decide
OL,16,Fto do with our very rare free
OL,17,Fweekend... climb Snowdon," it said.
